{"speciesId":787,"names":{"fr":"Tokotoro","es":"Tapu Bulu","en":"Tapu Bulu","ja":"カプ・ブルル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il arrache de grands arbres et fait des moulinets avec. Il a le pouvoir de rendre la végétation luxuriante pour ensuite se nourrir de cette force."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Arranca de cuajo árboles grandes para hacerlos girar. Vuelve exuberante la vegetación y luego absorbe su energía."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It pulls large trees up by the roots and swings them around. It causes vegetation to grow, and then it absorbs energy from the growth."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"大木を 引き抜き ブンブン 振り回す。 草木を 茂らせて そのエネルギーを 吸収する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"C’est l’indolent gardien d’Ula-Ula. Il se sert de la végétation pour immobiliser ses ennemis, avant de les empaler avec ses cornes."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"El indolente espíritu guardián de Ula-Ula. Inmoviliza al enemigo con la vegetación y lo embiste con sus cuernos."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"The guardian deity of Ula’ula is a lazy Pokémon. It commands plants to immobilize its foes and then deals them a savage blow with its horns."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ウラウラの 守り神で 物臭。 草木を 操り 敵を 縛りつけ 動きを 止めて 角で 一突き。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Bien qu’on le connaisse comme une divinité protectrice, il peut se montrer sans pitié envers ceux qu’il considère comme ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se lo conoce como espíritu guardián, pero abate sin piedad a aquellos que considera sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although it’s called a guardian deity, it’s violent enough to crush anyone it sees as an enemy."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"守り神と 呼ばれるが 敵と 見なした 者は 徹底的に 叩き潰す 激しさを 持っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il est le gardien d’Ula-Ula et le maître des plantes. Il évite les combats inutiles en faisant tinter sa queue pour signaler son arrivée."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"El espíritu guardián de Ula-Ula, que gobierna la flora. Hace repicar su cola para alertar de su presencia y prevenir riñas sin sentido."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It makes ringing sounds with its tail to let others know where it is, avoiding unneeded conflicts. This guardian deity of Ula’ula controls plants."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"シッポを 鳴らし 居場所を 伝え 無駄な争いを 避ける。 草木を 操る ウラウラの 守り神。"}],"varieties":[{"id":787,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",25]]},{"name":"horn-attack","learns":[[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",8],[20,"level-up",30]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"disable","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",10]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-drain","learns":[[20,"level-up",20]]},{"name":"leech-seed","learns":[[17,"level-up",26],[18,"level-up",26],[20,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"withdraw","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"reflect","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"skull-bash","learns":[[17,"level-up",58],[18,"level-up",58],[20,"level-up",70]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-slide","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"snore","lear